 * CLUSTER REPORT — AUTHORITATIVE AREA MANAGER BRANCH OWNERSHIP
 * FINAL OVERRIDE 2026-09-22
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------
 * This is intentionally placed at the VERY END of the page JavaScript.
 * It does not depend on Employee.custom_branch_list for these four Area
 * Managers. Every Cluster appointment is assigned by its branch first.
